# Fake runs and SDK tests need no API key. Live use reads the process environment only.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is required only for a separately authorized live evaluation.
# No dotenv loader is installed. Never place credentials in tracked files.

# Non-secret opt-in only in a reviewed Codex Cloud runtime (no dotenv loader):
# AGENTGUARD_HTTP_MODE=codex-cloud
# Preserve runtime HTTPS_PROXY and SSL_CERT_FILE/SSL_CERT_DIR; never paste secrets here.
